    "category": "class",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The wisdom and knowledge of your assembly fills your mind. You become trained in one of the skills corresponding to your current primary eidolon. At 8th level, you become expert in this skill and at 16th level you become master in this skill. When you change your primary eidolon, this skill changes as well.</p><p>Since this proficiency is temporary, it can't be used for prerequisites. If you have the same proficiency rank or higher in the skill your primary eidolon would grant, you instead gain a +1 circumstance bonus to that skill.</p><p>Pick the skill from the dropdown on your sheet's Actions tab when your primary eidolon changes, and turn on the second toggle if you already have that rank.</p>"
    },
    "level": {
      "value": 4
    },
    "prerequisites": {
